- AnkiConnect updateNoteFields: updates only specified fields, preserves scheduling
- SQLite concurrency: database locked while Anki is running
- genanki GUID default = hash of all fields; can customize to hash only key fields

The current project's problem:
- Uses importPackage which does delete+reimport cycle
- The GUID-based update mechanism means if you use stable GUIDs, re-importing the .apkg will UPDATE existing cards without duplicates

