- Option D: Hybrid - use AnkiConnect updateNoteFields for incremental updates + fallback to importPackage for bulk

The critical insight for this project:
- Currently using genanki default GUID = hash(all fields). This means when a field changes, the GUID changes, creating duplicates instead of updates.
- Fix: Use genanki.Note with custom guid based on stable identity fields (e.g., deck_id + card_index, or stem + form_index)

